{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23406","headline":"太湖石 · 白居易","name":"太湖石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远望老嵯峨，近观怪嶔崟。\n才高八九尺，势若千万寻。\n嵌空华阳洞，重叠匡山岑。\n邈矣仙掌迥，呀然劒门深。\n形质冠今古，气色通晴阴。\n未秋已瑟瑟，欲雨先沈沈。\n天姿信爲异，时用非所任。\n磨刀不如砺，捣帛不如砧。\n何乃主人意，重之如万金。\n岂伊造物者，独能知我心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}